"""S3 smoke — reset values match simulation state.

Pin reset terms to point intervals (no-op DR), reset the env, read state from sim,
assert match. The agent fills:

  TASK_ID                  — gym task id
  INIT_OVERRIDES_BLOCK     — Python lines that pin cfg.events.<term>.params to point intervals
                                  (e.g. cfg.events.reset_object_position.params["pose_range"] = ...)
